[TITLE]
BND-08: junction J1 with a bolted cover (Ymax 5 ft, Ysur 10 ft) and a ponded area
of 1000 ft2, ALLOW_PONDING YES. 10 cfs enters J1; its 1 ft outlet pipe C1 carries
less, so J1 must pressurize. Per the input manual, J1 ponds only once its depth
exceeds Ymax + Ysur = 15 ft.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
ALLOW_PONDING        YES
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         2
VARIABLE_STEP        0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1     0    5        0         10       1000

[OUTFALLS]
O1     -1   FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1     J1  O1  200  0.013  0  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
J1  FLOW  ""  FLOW 1.0 1.0 10

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
